      },
      "handwritten_answer": {
        "text": "解：$A=\\{x \\mid \\frac{2-x}{x+2}>0\\}$\n$\\therefore A=\\{x \\mid -2<x<2\\}$\n$B=\\{x \\mid |x-1|>2\\}$\n$\\therefore B=\\{x \\mid x<-1 \\text{或} x>3\\}$\n$\\therefore A \\cap B=\\{x \\mid -2<x<-1\\}$\n$(\\complement_R B)=\\{x \\mid -1 \\le x \\le 3\\}$\n$(\\complement_R B) \\cup A=\\{x \\mid -2<x \\le 3\\}$\n(2) $\\because A \\cap C=C$\n$\\therefore C \\subseteq A$",
