      "section_heading_before": "",
      "question_markdown": "16. (本小题满分 15 分) 已知 $a \\in \\mathbf{R}$，$p: \\forall x \\in \\{x \\mid 0 \\le x \\le 1\\}, a \\le x^2+1$；$q: \\exists x_0 \\in \\mathbf{R}, x_0^2+2ax_0-(2a-3)=0$。\n(1) 若 $p$ 是真命题，求 $a$ 的最大值；\n(2) 若 $p$ 为假命题且 $q$ 为真命题，求 $a$ 的取值范围。",
      "question_review": {
        "status": "reviewed_via_api2_atomic_patch",
        "source_context_ids": [
          "C004"
        ],
        "recognition_profile_version": "symbol_profile_v3",
        "symbol_audit_target_count": 0,
        "symbol_audit_observed_count": 0,
        "figure_audit_version": "figure_audit_v1",
        "figure_audit_target_count": 0,
        "figure_audit_observed_count": 0,
        "figure_observations": [],
        "lint_actions": [
          "kept_first_pass_answer_byte_exact"
        ],
        "context_manifest": "/home/puppeteer/MathOCRClaw/benchmark/test_runs/04-api2-triple-average/qwen3.7-plus/workflow/page25/code_outputs/match/question_contexts.json"
      },
      "handwritten_answer": {
        "text": "解：(1) $\\because p$ 为真命题\n$\\therefore$ 当 $x=1$ 时 $x^2+1$ 最大，此时 $x^2+1=2$\n$\\therefore$ 有 $a \\le 2$\n即 $a_{\\max}=2$\n(2) $\\because p$ 为假命题\n$\\therefore \\exists x \\in \\{x \\mid 0 \\le x \\le 1\\}, a>x^2+1$\n$\\therefore a>1$\n$\\therefore a>2$\n$\\because q$ 为真命题\n$\\therefore$ 存在方程 $x_0^2+2ax_0-(2a-3)=0$，\n$\\Delta=4a^2+4(2a-3)>0$\n即 $4a^2+8a-12>0$\n解得 $a<-3$ 或 $a>1$\n综上 $a$ 的取值范围为 $a \\le -3$ 或 $a>2$。",
